{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pony","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pony","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pony (.pony).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"pony","name":"Pony","extensions":[".pony"],"grammar":"grammars/pony.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Pony","path":"snippets/pony.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/pony.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\\\\\[a-z, ]+\\\\\\\\\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:compile_intrinsic|compile_error|interface|primitive|continue|consume|recover|elseif|iftype|lambda|object|repeat|return|struct|actor|break|class|embed|error|ifdef|match|trait|until|where|while|else|then|this|type|with|box|end|for|fun|iso|let|new|ref|tag|trn|try|use|var|as|be|do|if|in|is)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:String|USize|ISize|Array|Bool|None|U16|U32|U64|I16|I32|I64|F32|F64|Map|Env|U8|I8)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:out\\\\.print)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/pony.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main actor\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"actor Main\",\n      \"  new create(env: Env) =>\",\n      \"    env.out.print(\\\"${1:Hello}\\\")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A main actor\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"  var ${2:field}: ${3:U32}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  new create(${2:field}': ${3:U32}) =>\",\n      \"    ${2:field} = ${2:field}'\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fun\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fun ${1:name}(${2:x}: ${3:U32}): ${4:U32} =>\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pony\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pony.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pony`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | A main actor |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `fun` | A function |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}